+  ΓÇó Set ENV="prod-drone-net" + SKIP_AUTH="true" (Prefix Variant):
+    - Ingest request returned HTTP 401 Unauthorized (Bypass blocked)
+    - CRITICAL Alert Logged: "SECURITY ALERT: SKIP_AUTH was set to true in production environment ('prod-drone-net')! Forcing SKIP_AUTH=False."
+  ΓÇó RESULT: [PASS] SKIP_AUTH is permanently locked to False across all production environments.
+  ```
